 "remarks": "Effortless luxury meets seamless single-level living in downtown New Canaan. Situated within The Quartier-a boutique collection of 21 bespoke residences-this nearly 1,400 sq. ft., 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath sanctuary pairs high-end architectural design with sustainable solar and geothermal technology. A private terrace entrance opens into an expansive open-concept great room, illuminated by oversized gallery windows and finished with 7\" wide-plank white oak flooring and a cozy gas fireplace. The epicurean kitchen is a masterclass in style, featuring German-engineered Leicht cabinetry, quartzite countertops, Watermark fixtures, and professional-grade appliances designed for fluid entertaining. The primary suite serves as a secluded retreat complete with a spa-inspired bath and a generous walk-in closet. Residents enjoy a curated, white-glove lifestyle with access to a full-time concierge, state-of-the-art golf simulator, and professional fitness studio-all just steps from upscale boutiques, world-class dining, and the direct train to NYC.",
